    (replace) quando si aggiunge/elimina un commento. id stabile = contratto write↔read-side. %>
<span id="ticket_comments_count_<%= ticket.id %>" class="font-mono text-[11.5px] text-gray-400 dark:text-zinc-500 <%= "hidden" if count.zero? %>" data-test="member-ticket-comments-count"><%= count %></span>
